{"id":"663729","name":"板栗牛肋条焖饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/663729/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肩胛牛肋条","amount":"适量"},{"name":"板栗","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"大米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香菇泡发后切小块。","img":"images/663729/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"肩胛牛肋条用厨房纸擦干水份，改刀切块。","img":"images/663729/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"板栗处理好洗净。","img":"images/663729/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"胡萝卜去皮洗净切小块。","img":"images/663729/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大米清洗干净。","img":"images/663729/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中放入黄油。","img":"images/663729/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入牛肋条。","img":"images/663729/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煎至微微金黄。","img":"images/663729/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入香菇炒香。","img":"images/663729/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入板栗和胡萝卜炒匀。","img":"images/663729/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入洗净的大米。","img":"images/663729/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"适量蚝油，生抽，老抽炒匀上色。","img":"images/663729/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"炒好后转入电饭锅中。","img":"images/663729/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加入清水，水量跟平时煮饭的一样。","img":"images/663729/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"电饭锅开启煮饭模式即可。","img":"images/663729/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"出锅后翻拌均匀，加入适量葱花即可。","img":"images/663729/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663729/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663729/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663729/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}